        "language": "en",
        "text": {
          "status": "generated",
          "div": "<div xml:lang=\"en\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" lang=\"en\"><p>Laboratory report (synthetic): diabetes follow-up before travel for Arvid P24-Hackathon, issued by Clinical chemistry laboratory, Platform24 demo health centre (synthetic, P24-Hackathon).</p><p>Routine diabetes and blood pressure follow-up at the patient's Swedish health centre three weeks before his journey. Glucose control is above target; kidney function and potassium are normal on the blood-pressure medicine. Synthetic values for an invented person.</p></div>"
